19:24:03 [a47a] - narrative sequence language (Language forms used to organize story events and sequences.): e.g. first, then, next, after that, finally
19:24:03 [a47a] - perspective taking language (Language forms used to discuss thoughts, feelings, beliefs, and perspectives.): e.g. he thinks, she feels, they know, I wonder, maybe
